      <h3 data-page-node-id="CaNFfZeb703MCd7EMPJvOJ">循环神经网络</h3>
      <div class="en-name" data-page-node-id="87lSV8Drv2pF5op8qgkdcs">RNN · Recurrent Neural Network</div>
      <p class="desc" data-page-node-id="om9JnEEPKWiVsVqAOcqrcw">处理序列数据的核心架构，通过隐藏状态记忆历史信息。涵盖 BPTT、LSTM、GRU 等关键变体，是理解 Transformer 的重要基础。</p>
      <div class="tags" data-page-node-id="Kqrof5sSoFbYeswA0F9HFX"><span class="tag tag-blue" data-page-node-id="fZrGjEH8Ka1Hy1VMtqQwQE">深度学习</span><span class="tag tag-purple" data-page-node-id="XUk6SGYrovPOd9HxwEvDgC">序列建模</span></div>
      <div class="meta" data-page-node-id="qZ2T3LbCUegOAa4y5cPBZ9"><span class="count" data-page-node-id="jpfu0kX78yJ7qyJs6TAbhG">18 公式 / 12 SVG / 7 代码</span><span class="arrow" data-page-node-id="vXqoACgRkJo4v7VxQYpzCk">&#8594;</span></div>
    </a>

    <!-- ResNet -->
