      <p class="desc" data-page-node-id="xFDxbc2PYy0dHGRBXKXMXl">在非欧图结构上学习的深度学习架构，通过消息传递聚合邻居信息。涵盖 GCN、GAT、GraphSAGE、GIN 等核心模型。</p>
      <div class="tags" data-page-node-id="gtxcEkjsaAEBSxnkin7HdA"><span class="tag tag-purple" data-page-node-id="TJHaBA0odO3H9SgS6s9RDH">图学习</span><span class="tag tag-blue" data-page-node-id="RC6aTHESXSkopLavzbLTvM">深度学习</span></div>
